  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement in the Quality of Maternal Health Care at the 1st level Integral Health Center in the city of El Alto, Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1 Improve integrated health centers&apos; condition for safe delivery , 2 Reinforcing the operation of integrated health centers , 3 Capacity building for health professionals of integrated health centers 4.Strengthening the role of traditional midwives in the community , 5 Establishment of maternal and child health information system in the community</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce preventable deaths and improve health by improving access to maternal health services for vulnerable groups (indigenous people, women) in El Alto&#xC548;&#xC804;&#xD55C; &#xBD84;&#xB9CC;&#xC774; &#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC18C; &#xC2DC;&#xC124; &#xBC0F; &#xD658;&#xACBD; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;, &#xD1B5;&#xD569;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC18C; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xC804;&#xD1B5;&#xC0B0;&#xD30C;&#xC758; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xACF5;&#xC2DD;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC758;&#xB8CC; &#xCCB4;&#xACC4;&#xC218;&#xB834; &#xBC0F; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xBCF4;&#xC870;&#xC778;&#xB825;&#xC73C;&#xB85C; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC815;&#xBCF4; &#xC804;&#xC0B0;&#xD654;</narrative>
